<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76571" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παίδειος</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδεῖος</span></b>  (Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.135
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδικός</span>
			, <i>of</i> or <i>for a boy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕμνοι π.</span> songs <i>to the boys they loved</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.601a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κρέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1242
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				1593
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τροφή</span> the care <i>of
				rearing children, a mother's</i> cares, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				918
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. οἰκοδομήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					643b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάθημα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				747b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ π. τιμαί</span> honours
				<i>bestowed on children</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				810a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδεῖον, τό</span>, <i>boy's dress</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1516.8
			</span></i>.</div>
